Body Shape Selection with Guide :As selected gender above, and only relevant body shape options appear.

For Males:

Rectangle: Equal shoulders, waist, and hips.

Triangle: Shoulders narrower than waist/hips.

Inverted Triangle: Shoulders wider than waist/hips.

Oval: Waist wider than shoulders/hips.

Trapezoid: Shoulders > Waist > Hips (balanced proportion).

For Females:

Hourglass: Bust and hips equal, with a smaller waist.

Pear/Triangle: Hips wider than bust/shoulders.

Apple/Inverted Triangle: Bust/shoulders wider than hips.

Rectangle: Bust, waist, and hips equal.

Spoon: Defined hip curve, wider hips.

Diamond: Waist wider than bust/hips.

Oval: Rounded shape with a larger bust and stomach.

